		     come from AdsConfig; it must match liveAppIdIos in
		     lib/services/ads_config.dart, and a test fails if it doesn't. -->
		<key>GADApplicationIdentifier</key>
		<string>ca-app-pub-8287765177319119~8155905694</string>
		<!-- Without this, the SDK starts sending app-measurement events to
		     Google as soon as the process starts, before Dart ever calls
		     MobileAds.instance.initialize() — which AdsProvider gates on
		     setup, the walkthrough and consent (ADS-4, ADS-5), and never
		     calls at all once "Remove ads" is bought (ADS-8, PAY-1). -->
		<key>GADDelayAppMeasurementInit</key>
